tags: notice, stop notice, hibernate notice

A setting of the start of the service: the service reads the notices of the node on
the first virtio console of the guest. A notice tells the service that the node will
stop or hibernate the instance soon, so that the service can save its work.

The value is empty. Any other value is not valid.

The node writes one line for each notice to the console /dev/hvc0. A line is ASCII
text, 128 bytes or less, with a newline at its end: a verb, one space, and a unix time
in seconds. The verbs are STOP and HIBERNATE. Example: "STOP 1795713400". At that
time the node stops or hibernates the instance, also if the service is not ready. The
service ignores a line with a verb that it does not know. The node can write other
bytes to the console: the service ignores a line that does not have this form.

With no setting, the node sends no notice.
The node is bound: it sends the notice for each stop or hibernation that the instance
did not ask for. A node that cannot write to the console of the guest refuses the
service.

=== formal
channel=the port 0 of the first console device (section 5.3 of the document 0e5751c026e543b2e8ab2eb06099daa1d1e5df47778f7787faab45cdf12fe3a8:9d8cb1d5c69354bcad0748d3e7f16adb0fb533f70cd5db412e5134410c01beb5) of the virtual machine (the concept 0e5751c026e543b2e8ab2eb06099daa1d1e5df47778f7787faab45cdf12fe3a8:b3469e385a533a222a75a1aeafb1a94b2795a9f689e302f034283e1d8cdceb38); in the guest it is the character special file (definition 3.62 (Character Special File) of the document 0e5751c026e543b2e8ab2eb06099daa1d1e5df47778f7787faab45cdf12fe3a8:5dd925be58ed836308859cb1796d9006a7ff6b32eaa1281fd0f28c4604773ed9) /dev/hvc0, with the major number 229 and the minor number 0 (the document 0e5751c026e543b2e8ab2eb06099daa1d1e5df47778f7787faab45cdf12fe3a8:94a1742f92c7a0c425a9ec8977b4edd0889d54c339f1cdc72e338e1cab54dbae)
class=setting
default=absent: the node sends no notice
line=characters of the concept 0e5751c026e543b2e8ab2eb06099daa1d1e5df47778f7787faab45cdf12fe3a8:24801bc1176a41ff5f2aa2b94f8a3186eb42a69b5d68437e6e849c83bb443895 with the values 32 to 126, in this order: <verb>, a space (the byte 32), <time>, a newline (the byte 10); at most 128 bytes with the newline
name=notice
place=service.container.init
time=<time> is the number of seconds since 00:00:00 of 1 January 1970 in the time of the concept 0e5751c026e543b2e8ab2eb06099daa1d1e5df47778f7787faab45cdf12fe3a8:76016d6a59ad50c6aed0620ea7d772e9f3ec634a40cac7a94785b23768dae900, with no leap seconds, base 10; the node stops or hibernates the instance at this time, whether the service is ready or not
value=empty
verb.unknown=the service ignores the line
verbs=HIBERNATE,STOP
when=before each stop and each hibernation that the instance did not ask for
